<title>NETHERLANDS: Flexovit sets stock div at 1 per 32.</title>
<headline>Flexovit sets stock div at 1 per 32.</headline>
<dateline>DEVENTER, Netherlands 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abrasives maker Flexovit International said on Monday it had set its optional 1996 stock dividend at one new share per 32 held.</p>
<p>In March, Flexovit announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 60 Dutch cents, down from 1.12 guilders in the previous year. The 1996 payment could be taken up in cash or as an alternative dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Flexovit's shares closed at 20.50 guilders on Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday, up 30 cents from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
